      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "那么如何定义LBH",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720365312",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, SimSun",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "个护家电创新产品的潮流引领者",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720668783",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, SimSun",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "45px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器的创业之旅始于2020年，是一家专注于高速电机应用的个护小家电设计、开发、制造和销售的科技公司；我们不仅追求产品的技术领先地位，更注重设计美学和用户体验，力求使每一款产品都能在市场中占据主导地位。自成立以来，LBH电器一直引领着个护家电的设计潮流和技术应用的创新，致力于打造极致的产品体验——未来也将继续如此。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720668778",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "顶级品牌合作伙伴",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720668798",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, SimSun",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "45px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们已与供应商建立了战略合作关系，并充分利用供应链优势，为客户提供更优质的服务；LBH电器已与众多世界知名品牌建立了长期合作伙伴关系，展望未来，LBH电器始终秉承“唯有走在市场前沿才能获得无可比拟的优势”的理念，这使我们成为诸多品牌最佳合作伙伴。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720668799",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH产品认证",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724143021",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们有何不同？",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720753102",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "永不止步地追求卓越",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(220, 68, 5)"
    },
    {
      "text": "永远不要满足于已取得的成就，保持市场领先地位需要我们团队每一位成员的全力以赴。当有机会做得更好时，我们没有任何理由拒绝付出额外的努力。",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "做好迎接任何挑战的准备",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们每天都会面临挑战，生活中的挑战无法预料，我们能做的就是做好心理和情感上的准备。每当遇到障碍时，我们都需要运用智慧将其分解，然后采取行动。",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "思考并做新的事情",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们深知，没有失败就没有创新和创造力；探索未知的海洋不仅需要一支勇敢的航海团队，更需要敢于探索未知海岸的勇气；在LBH电器，我们珍视创新，并乐于接受充满建设性冲突的过程。",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "聚焦才能看到光明",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "没有人会闭着眼睛射击目标，无论何时你想达成目标，都要睁大眼睛，集中注意力，确保你清楚自己想要什么；专注于你的目标，像激光束一样聚焦。最终，我们关注的事物会成长。",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_720669060",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH 文化核心：相信才能看见",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720669076",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的使命",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720789971",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "为优秀员工创建一个平台",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790034",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器是一家愿意为员工的成长贡献力量并分享成长机会的公司，只要有机会进修，我们都会竭尽全力去实现。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790033",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "为我们信赖的客户创造价值",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790035",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "客户的利益高于一切,LBH电器始终从客户的角度考虑问题，不断努力提高客户满意度，并致力于建立长期、互信且有意义的客户关系。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790038",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "为行业和社会进步做出贡献",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790036",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们致力于通过日常创新，不断提升个护家电行业标准；我们的贡献包括更优质的产品体验、更先进的制造技术和更多就业机会。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790039",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "倾听客户的声音",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720790069",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH为我们定制的高速吹风机产品在设计和产品技术方面均处于领先地位。面对激烈的市场竞争，凭借产品独特的差异化和卓越的用户体验，我们在短时间内迅速获得了很高的市场份额。LBH团队兑现了他们最初对我们的承诺。如今，我们已成功开拓了新的国内市场，与LBH的深度合作仍在继续。感谢LBH团队的辛勤付出。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724199832",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— Jeff Deng",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724199833",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH是我们合作过的最有效率的团队。从第一次会议到最终产品交付，仅仅用了两个多月的时间，这在以前是难以想象的！更重要的是，新产品的开发过程很好地规避了专利问题。消费者非常喜欢我们的产品风格，产品上市后也获得了良好的市场反馈。未来我们将继续携手开发更多创新产品。LBH团队让我们感到非常安心！",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724199836",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— Warren Steve",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724199838",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LHB为我们定制的高速吹风机产品在设计和产品技术方面都处于领先地位。面对激烈的市场竞争，产品的独特差异化和用户体验使我们在很短的时间内获得了很高的市场份额。LHB团队兑现了他们对我们的最初承诺。我们现已开拓了新的国际市场，与LHB的更深入合作仍在继续。感谢 LHB 团队的努力。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724199837",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
